                <pb facs="0882" n="848" sameAs="frus:frus1964-68v07/pg848"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following change has been made to <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                        Relations</hi>, 1964–1968, Volume VII, Vietnam, September 1968–January 1969.
                    Please be aware that printed volumes have not been revised.
                    <!--Revised information is in italic.--></p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#d255-f5">Footnote 5, Document
                                255</ref>, Page 756 (date of correction: December 16,
                        2016)</hi></item>
                    <item>The cross reference to <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>,
                        1964–1968, Volume VI, footnote 2, Document 312 was corrected to footnote 2,
                        Document 315</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
